#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Cluster-level resources {#cluster-level-resources}"
msgstr "Risorse a livello di cluster {#cluster-level-resources}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here, we demonstrate how utilizing 128 threads on a cluster allows us to "
